-2-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-28_"><b>About Penta Motor Group</b></span></h3><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-29_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:20px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-30_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-31_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-33_">Born in 2011, <span style="font-weight: bold;">Penta Motor Group</span> didn't just enter the automotive world - we roared onto the scene. Today, we operate 4 franchised dealerships across Gauteng and North West, representing some of the world's most exciting brands: <span style="font-weight: bold;"><a href="/collections/suzuki" target="_self">Suzuki</a></span>, <span style="font-weight: bold;"><a href="/collections/mahindra" target="_self">Mahindra</a></span>, <span style="font-weight: bold;"><a href="/collections/renault" target="_self">Renault</a></span>, <span style="font-weight: bold;"><a href="/collections/omoda" target="_self">Omoda</a></span>, and <span style="font-weight: bold;"><a href="/collections/jaecoo" target="_self">Jaecoo</a></span>. And with <span style="font-weight: bold;">7</span> <span style="font-weight: bold;">Penta Now </span>used vehicle outlets, finding your next <strong><a href="/collections/used-vehicles" target="_self">pre-owned</a></strong> car has never been easier or more accessible.<br><br>Our team aren't just car people - they're automotive alchemists, turning years of expertise into unparalleled service and genuine customer care. We don't just sell cars, we craft journeys. From sleek city cruisers to rugged off-road beasts, we have the perfect vehicle to fuel your next adventure — backed by seamless financing and comprehensive aftersales support.<br><br>
Ready to ditch the ordinary and drive extraordinary?
</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-34_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-35_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-37_">With <b>over 20 years of experience</b> in the motor retail industry, the Dealer Principals and key role players leading the establishment of the Penta Motor Group, have prided themselves in achieving and exceeding excellent customer service through our team's personality, the quality of our products as well as our infrastructure. <br><br>Join the Penta Motor Group family today!</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-38_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:20px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-39_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bfhwqR issLwU pf-40_ pf-icon2-2"><path d="M128 32h32c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32V96H96V64c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32zm64 96V448c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32H32c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32V388.9c0-34.6 9.4-68.6 27.2-98.3C40.9 267.8 49.7 242.4 53 216L60.5 156c2-16 15.6-28 31.8-28H192zm227.8 0c16.1 0 29.8 12 31.8 28L459 216c3.3 26.4 12.1 51.8 25.8 74.6c17.8 29.7 27.2 63.7 27.2 98.3V448c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32H352c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32V128h99.8zM320 64c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32h32c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32V96H320V64zm-32 64V288H224V128h64z"></path></svg><div data-pf-type="Custom.HTML" class="sc-lbJdeI bvzyhN pf-41_"><style>
