310_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-312_">Penta ventures into the fleet and rental market<span style="font-weight: 400;">,</span> launching Drive<span style="font-weight: 400;"> and </span>Penta Fleet Solutions<span style="font-weight: 400;">. This year also holds some excitement with the </span>opening of our Chery floor <span style="font-weight: normal;">at</span> Penta Menlyn<span style="font-weight: 400;">. In addition, PMG officially </span><span style="font-weight: normal;">won</span> Suzuki's volume dealer of the year award 2020<span style="font-weight: 400;"> with </span>Suzuki Rustenburg<span style="font-weight: 400;"> being the overall dealer of the year.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-313_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-314_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-dycZeM hVZvYw pf-315_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-318_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-319_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-321_">2022</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-322_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-dycZeM hVZvYw pf-323_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-326_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-dJjagV faqBYR pf-327_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-329_"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Penta opens the <strong>PMG fitment centre</strong>, providing vehicle customisations to meet the unique needs of our clients.